# A Mountain controlled by the attacker does not let the Sled attack a player with no Mountain; Ornithopter can attack that player (CR 508.1c).
[Bot1 Deck]
Goblin Rock Sled
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mountain
Ornithopter
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Goblin Rock Sled.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
! Bot1.Attack(Goblin Rock Sled > Bot2)
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Rock Sled.Tapped = false
